  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "The task has been fully completed. All required components of the agent-autonomy-kit workflow pack are in place:\n\n1. **Task Queue (tasks/QUEUE.md)** - Contains Ready/In Progress/Blocked/Done sections with 2 completed tasks and 2 blocked tasks\n2. **Heartbeat Routine (HEARTBEAT.md)** - Already existed with the kit's workflow\n3. **Daily Progress Memory Template (memory/daily_progress_template.md)** - Created with proper structure for agent logging\n4. **Cron Plan (cron_plan.json)** - Updated with priority ordering: human_requests → urgent_blockers → ready_tasks\n\nAll files use the kit's language and emoji conventions (🔴🟡🟢🔄✅) and are ready for a proactive agent to use.",
